**DIRAC
.TITLE
  Na atom
.WAVE F ! Activate integral and wave functions modules
.ANALYZE
**GENERAL
.DIRECT
1 1 1
**INTEGRALS
.PRINT
1
.NUCMOD ! 1-Point nucleus, 2-gaussian
2
*READIN
.UNCONTRACTED
**HAMILTONIAN
.PRINT
2
# add finite perturbation
.OPERATOR
 ZDIPLEN
 COMFACTOR
 +0.0000
.INTFLG
1 1 0
#.URKBAL
**WAVE FUNCTIONS ! What method (DHF,MP2,CC..)
.SCF
*SCF
# 1s(2) 2s(2) 2p(6)
.CLOSED SHELL
10
# 3s(1)
.OPEN SHELL
1
1/2
.EVCCNV ! Energy convergence...
1.0D-9  1.0D-6
#################################################
**ANALYZE
.MULPOP
*MULPOP
.VECPOP
all   
*END OF
